# inc-u3dp phase 4: the countersong case opens the Bardic Music menu once.
# The probe grants CA_BARDIC_MUSIC level 5 first, so the menu is Inspire
# Courage, Fascination, Countersong (src/Skills.cpp:2183-2187). DOWN*2
# highlights Countersong; ENTER sings it. The final s keeps the run in play
# so the harness counts it as gameplay.
# The step case moves the player next to a hostile rat and the game asks a
# yes/no question; n declines it. The first key is that answer.
n
DOWN*2
ENTER
s
@dump:hide-distraction
